  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 制作的模组。充满爱意打造。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>被动护盾是一个可配置的模组，对护盾机制进行了一些改动。当副手持盾且未使用时，护盾将不会渲染。当玩家右键举起护盾时，护盾会再次显示。当护盾未举起时，它仍然可以抵消部分伤害。默认额外抵消33%伤害，但可以在配置文件中更改。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>当护盾在主手闲置时，同样提供被动保护。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于原版体验整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg&w=718\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 客户端合集\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端与服务端\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示隐藏内容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>hideShieldWhenNotInUse</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>启用后，除非玩家按下右键，否则护盾将被隐藏。<br><br><span><strong>passiveShieldPercentageDamageNegated</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 0.3333，最小 0.0，最大 1.0<br>当玩家手持未举起的护盾受到攻击时，被抵消伤害的百分比。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>当副手持盾且未举起时，护盾会隐藏：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示隐藏内容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"528\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>无盾时的默认伤害：</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示隐藏内容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"528\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>副手持盾未举起时，护盾被动抵消伤害：</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示隐藏内容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"530\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>主手持盾未举起时，护盾被动抵消伤害：</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示隐藏内容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用本模组，但下载文件必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如果您有问题、创意、建议或其他需求，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
